# SOT-23-5: irregular pins, listed side by side under `pins`.

footprint "SOT-23-5"
  description: "SOT-23-5 (JEDEC MO-178): 3 pins one side, 2 opposite at the outer positions"
  refdes: "U"

  body 1.6 x 2.9 x 1.1
  pins
    left: 1, 2, 3 pitch: 0.95  # the left side runs top to bottom,
    right: 4, nc, 5            # the right side bottom to top. `nc` leaves the
  end                          # middle empty, so pins 4 and 5 are 1.9 apart
  lead gullwing 0.4 x 0.6 span: 2.8
  pin1: dot
end
